    %% Architecture Connections
    Users -->|User requests| AzureFrontDoor
    AzureFrontDoor -->|HTTPS routing for Finnair| AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair
    AzureFrontDoor -->|HTTPS routing for KLM| AzureApplicationGatewayKLM
    AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair -->|Backend routing for Finnair| AzureAppServicePlanFinnair
    AzureApplicationGatewayKLM -->|Backend routing for KLM| AzureAppServicePlanKLM
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Data queries for Finnair| AzurePostgreSQLServer
    AzureAppServicePlanKLM -->|Data queries for KLM| AzurePostgreSQLServer
    AzureFunctions -->|Cache access| AzureRedisCache
    AzureFunctions -->|Secrets retrieval| AzureKeyVaultShared
    AzureFunctions -->|Telemetry| ApplicationInsights
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API gateway routing| AzureFunctions
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Data storage| AzureStorageAccountFinnair
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Data storage| AzureStorageAccountKLM
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Secrets & certificate management| AzureKeyVaultSecurity
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API gateway routing| AzureAppConfiguration
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| LogAnalyticsWorkspace
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureMonitor
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Security monitoring| MicrosoftDefenderforCloud
    AzureFirewallPremium -->|Secrets & certificate management| AzureKeyVaultSecurity
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Security monitoring| MicrosoftSentinel
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Content delivery| AzureDDoSProtection
    AzureAppServicePlanKLM -->|Data storage| AzureStorageAccountKLM
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Health monitoring| AzureMonitor
    AzureAppServicePlanFinnair -->|Caching for Finnair portal| AzureCacheforRedis
    AzureStorageAccountFinnair -->|Secure storage access| PrivateEndpoint

